          "description": "Everybody Sing! has been created to help kids explore and enjoy their voices. From giggle-inducing tongue twisters to imaginative breathing techniques, every chapter is crafted to captivate young minds and spark creativity. Whether your child dreams of the spotlight or just loves to sing along, Everybody Sing will have them belting out tunes with joy.\n\nDiscover: 2 tracks. \nAvailable until 30th June.\n Full Card: 13 tracks. \nFor ages 3-12\n\n\t•\tExpertly designed vocal exercises created specifically for children.\n\t•\tInteractive songs that teach singing fundamentals like pitch, rhythm, and breath control.\n\t•\tEncourages creativity, self-confidence, and a love of music.\n\t•\tIdeal for ages 4-10, suitable for beginners and young singing enthusiasts.\n\nLet your child’s voice soar and their love for music grow with Everybody Sing!",
